{"nodes": [{"id": "skills_skills_skills_engineering_ask_matt_skill_askmatt", "label": "Ask Matt Router", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "skills/skills/engineering/ask-matt/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "You don't remember every skill, so ask: most paths run along one main flow, two on-ramps merge onto it, everything else is standalone or a vocabulary layer that runs underneath."}, {"id": "skills_skills_skills_engineering_ask_matt_skill_mainflow", "label": "Main Flow: idea to ship", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "skills/skills/engineering/ask-matt/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Context hygiene: keep grilling, spec and tickets in one unbroken context window \u2014 don't compact or clear until after /to-tickets; each /implement then starts fresh, working from the ticket."}, {"id": "skills_skills_skills_engineering_ask_matt_skill_onramp", "label": "On-ramp", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "skills/skills/engineering/ask-matt/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A starting situation that generates work, then merges onto the main flow; triage is only for issues you didn't create, because /to-tickets output is already agent-ready."}, {"id": "skills_skills_skills_engineering_ask_matt_skill_smartzone", "label": "Smart Zone", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "skills/skills/engineering/ask-matt/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The window (~120k tokens on state-of-the-art models) within which the model still reasons sharply; if a session approaches it before /to-tickets, handoff and continue in a fresh thread rather than pushing on degraded."}, {"id": "skills_skills_skills_en